### Create a constrained inventory position
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "IPAD-MINI-128-BLU",
  "product_name": "iPad Mini 128GB Blue",
  "on_hand": 28,
  "reorder_point": 30,
  "daily_demand": 12,
  "supplier_lead_days": 5
}

### Reserve stock; this produces an explainable critical alert
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "evt-demo-2026-0001",
  "event_type": "inventory_reserved",
  "sku": "IPAD-MINI-128-BLU",
  "quantity": 8
}

### Replaying the same event is safe and makes no extra stock mutation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "evt-demo-2026-0001",
  "event_type": "inventory_reserved",
  "sku": "IPAD-MINI-128-BLU",
  "quantity": 8
}

